@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 08. Supervisor Agent Exception Handling

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

class SupervisorA2AController
class SupervisorAgentService
class SupervisorAgentOrchestrator
class LlmHitlPolicyService
class LlmSupervisorResponseComposeService
class DefaultA2AInvocationService
class A2AJsonRpcClient
class GlobalExceptionHandler

class A2ARoutingException
class DownstreamA2AException
class SupervisorChatProcessingException
class ChatProcessingException
class WebClientResponseException
class HttpMessageNotReadableException
class IllegalArgumentException
class IllegalStateException

SupervisorA2AController --> SupervisorAgentService
SupervisorAgentService --> SupervisorAgentOrchestrator
SupervisorAgentService --> LlmHitlPolicyService
SupervisorAgentOrchestrator --> LlmSupervisorResponseComposeService
SupervisorAgentOrchestrator --> DefaultA2AInvocationService
DefaultA2AInvocationService --> A2AJsonRpcClient

DefaultA2AInvocationService --> A2ARoutingException : invalid route / method
A2AJsonRpcClient --> DownstreamA2AException : downstream A2A failure
LlmSupervisorResponseComposeService --> SupervisorChatProcessingException : compose/planning failure
SupervisorAgentOrchestrator --> IllegalStateException : state/persistence mismatch
SupervisorA2AController --> IllegalArgumentException : validator / params
SupervisorA2AController --> HttpMessageNotReadableException : invalid JSON
A2AJsonRpcClient --> WebClientResponseException : upstream HTTP failure

GlobalExceptionHandler --> ChatProcessingException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> RuntimeException : name-based mapping\nA2ARoutingException / DownstreamA2AException /\nSupervisorChatProcessingException
GlobalExceptionHandler --> IllegalArgumentException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> IllegalStateException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> WebClientResponseException : @ExceptionHandler
GlobalExceptionHandler --> HttpMessageNotReadableException : @ExceptionHandler

note bottom of GlobalExceptionHandler
Return sanitized response
- /a2a/** -> JsonRpcResponse(error)
- non-A2A -> ErrorResponse
- no downstream raw body/header leak
- many JSON-RPC validation errors are returned directly by controller/validator without throwing
end note
@enduml
